  - all rest rotations were mirrored (the `.bbmodel` got file-convention angles);
  - sides were swapped (the weapon was in the left hand);
  - z-fighting (dragon brow, quadruped legs, golem rune);
  - floating dragon wings;
  - death poses through the floor;
  - elemental spin keys past the clip length.

